    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Classical era: clarity, balance, sonata form. Haydn, Mozart, early Beethoven."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ensemble",
      "title": "Ensemble",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "String quartet crystallised as conversation between equals. Symphony orchestra standardised sections."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "public-concerts",
      "title": "Public concerts",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Music moved from court patronage toward public ticket sales — amateur music-making in homes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "piano-replaces-harpsichord",
      "title": "Piano replaces harpsichord",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Dynamic nuance of fortepiano suited Classical expressiveness."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
